lo has issued a\n\n* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...\nNorthwestern Prowers County in southeastern Colorado...\nEastern Kiowa County in southeastern Colorado...\nNortheastern Bent County in southeastern Colorado...\n\n* Until 715 PM MDT.\n\n* At 625 PM MDT, severe thunderstorms were located along a line\nextending from near Hasty to 8 miles southwest of Lamar, moving\nnortheast at 70 mph.\n\nHAZARD...70 mph wind gusts and quarter size hail.\n\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\n\nIMPACT...Hail damage to vehicles is expected. Expect considerable\ntree damage. Wind damage is also likely to mobile homes,\nroofs, and outbuildings.\n\n* Locations impacted include...\nLamar, Eads, Wiley, Neeoshe Reservoir, McClave, Bristol, Sweetwater\nReservoir, Chivington, Brandon, Neegronda Reservoir, and Queens\nReservoir.","ends":"2026-08-31T19:15:00-06:00","severity":"Severe","areaDesc":"Bent, CO; Kiowa, CO; Prowers, CO","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.231e5e01d6aaf7d1086cfb61cb3e7ae0335439b4.001.1","url":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.231e5e01d6aaf7d1086cfb61cb3e7ae0335439b4.001.1"}],"afd":{"office":"PUB","issued":"2026-08-31T23:41:00+00:00","snippet":"000 FXUS65 KPUB 312341 AFDPUB Area Forecast Discussion National Weather Service Pueblo CO 541 PM MDT Mon Aug 31 2026 .KEY MESSAGES... - Shortwave will move across the region bring showers and thunderstorms to the area late this afternoon and evening; some of the activity will move across during the late evening/early AM hours. - Drier weather Tuesday through Thursday - Better monsoon flow pattern ","url":"https://forecast.weather.gov/product.php?site=PUB&issuedby=PUB&product=AFD&format=CI"},"hwo":{"office":"PUB","issued":"2026-08-31T17:35:00+00:00","snippet":"000 FLUS45 KPUB 311735 HWOPUB Hazardous Weather Outlook National Weather Service Pueblo CO 1135 AM MDT Mon Aug 31 2026 COZ058>089-093>099-011745- Western Mosquito Range/East Lake County Above 11000 Feet- Leadville Vicinity/Lake County Below 11000 Feet- Eastern Saw